<title>UK: TMCC UPS ONE-YEAR BOND TO 150 MLN RAND.</title>
<headline>TMCC UPS ONE-YEAR BOND TO 150 MLN RAND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to 150 million rand from 100 million rand, lead</p>
<p>manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CORP					     </p>
<p> AMT  **150 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.75     MATURITY    25.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE **101.081  PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	**ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN RAND AT 100.9137  </p>
<p>		ON 05.FEB.97</p>
</text>
